              "text": "विजयः — vijayaḥ — \"a victory\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अन्ते सेनायाः विजयः भवति। ante senāyāḥ vijayaḥ bhavati. In the end the army wins the victory."
            },
